
                             RUST SUPPORT IN KERNEL
                             ----------------------

1. Introduction
----------------

Enable rust support in kernel for sdk

If you need more details, Please see https://docs.kernel.org/rust/index.html

2. Usage
--------

Add this template using the following configure script option.
i.e.: --templates feature/rust-in-kernel-sdk

This will ensure the required config values are set and  will enable support
for rust  kernel module development on sdk.
